    "detailed_description": "<h1>Try the Demo!</h1><p>Aground started as a free web game, but after getting excellent ratings and over 3 million plays across many portals, we decided to expand it into the full version! The web version is still available as a free demo covering the first few islands that will give you a great sense of the game. Give it a try! Your saves will transfer seamlessly to the full version should you decide to get it!</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Survival</strong> is only the beginning. The only way for humanity to have a <strong>future</strong> is to return to the <strong>stars</strong> and confront <i>them</i>. But, it will require a lot of ingenuity and help to recover everything that was lost, and even that might not be enough...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876650/extras/0a7a2618b58fc53e7ef64b501849a2c2.poster.avif?t=1732740414\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876650/extras/0a7a2618b58fc53e7ef64b501849a2c2.webm?t=1732740414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876650/extras/0a7a2618b58fc53e7ef64b501849a2c2.mp4?t=1732740414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Aground is a Mining/Crafting RPG, where there is an overarching goal, story and reason to craft and build. As you progress, you will meet new NPCs, unlock new technology, and maybe magic too. <strong>Will you be able to raise dragons? Launch into space? The sky is literally not the limit.</strong> Beneath its simple exterior, Aground hides a lot of <strong>depth</strong> and surprises that will keep you wondering \u201cwhat\u2019s next?\u201d<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876650/extras/3b8083a9a58e44f48018f29c7fb68438.poster.avif?t=1732740414\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876650/extras/3b8083a9a58e44f48018f29c7fb68438.webm?t=1732740414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876650/extras/3b8083a9a58e44f48018f29c7fb68438.mp4?t=1732740414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Want more in the Aground universe? Try the 3D spinoff game <strong>Aground Zero</strong>!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876650/extras/fb7da1804f2b76c39e4a294fbddbd779.poster.avif?t=1732740414\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876650/extras/fb7da1804f2b76c39e4a294fbddbd779.webm?t=1732740414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876650/extras/fb7da1804f2b76c39e4a294fbddbd779.mp4?t=1732740414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What can you do in Aground?</h2><br>While it starts simple, Aground slowly evolves into a much larger game with tons of features and things to do. Here is an incomplete list:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Mine Ores, Gems, and other Resources<br></li><li>Build Structures<br></li><li>Complete Quests<br></li><li>Fight Enemies and Bosses<br></li><li>Craft Tools<br></li><li>Farm Crops<br></li><li>Cook Foods<br></li><li>Befriend NPCs (or not)<br></li><li>Advance your Technology<br></li><li>Discover Magic<br></li><li>Ride Vehicles and Mounts<br></li><li>Travel to other Islands and Planets<br></li><li>Raise Dragons<br></li><li>Capture Enemies<br></li><li>Level up your Skills<br></li><li>Go Fishing<br></li><li>Explore Secrets</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Who are We?</h2><br>We\u2019re Fancy Fish Games - a small indie team that has released 12 games, 5 commercially on Steam (including Aground), since 2012. We follow our passion, making games that catch our fancy - our games tend to be quirky, surprising or thought-provoking.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Survival</strong> is only the beginning. The only way for humanity to have a <strong>future</strong> is to return to the <strong>stars</strong> and confront <i>them</i>. But, it will require a lot of ingenuity and help to recover everything that was lost, and even that might not be enough...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876650/extras/0a7a2618b58fc53e7ef64b501849a2c2.poster.avif?t=1732740414\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876650/extras/0a7a2618b58fc53e7ef64b501849a2c2.webm?t=1732740414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876650/extras/0a7a2618b58fc53e7ef64b501849a2c2.mp4?t=1732740414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Aground is a Mining/Crafting RPG, where there is an overarching goal, story and reason to craft and build. As you progress, you will meet new NPCs, unlock new technology, and maybe magic too. <strong>Will you be able to raise dragons? Launch into space? The sky is literally not the limit.</strong> Beneath its simple exterior, Aground hides a lot of <strong>depth</strong> and surprises that will keep you wondering \u201cwhat\u2019s next?\u201d<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876650/extras/3b8083a9a58e44f48018f29c7fb68438.poster.avif?t=1732740414\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876650/extras/3b8083a9a58e44f48018f29c7fb68438.webm?t=1732740414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876650/extras/3b8083a9a58e44f48018f29c7fb68438.mp4?t=1732740414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Want more in the Aground universe? Try the 3D spinoff game <strong>Aground Zero</strong>!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876650/extras/fb7da1804f2b76c39e4a294fbddbd779.poster.avif?t=1732740414\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876650/extras/fb7da1804f2b76c39e4a294fbddbd779.webm?t=1732740414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876650/extras/fb7da1804f2b76c39e4a294fbddbd779.mp4?t=1732740414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What can you do in Aground?</h2><br>While it starts simple, Aground slowly evolves into a much larger game with tons of features and things to do. Here is an incomplete list:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Mine Ores, Gems, and other Resources<br></li><li>Build Structures<br></li><li>Complete Quests<br></li><li>Fight Enemies and Bosses<br></li><li>Craft Tools<br></li><li>Farm Crops<br></li><li>Cook Foods<br></li><li>Befriend NPCs (or not)<br></li><li>Advance your Technology<br></li><li>Discover Magic<br></li><li>Ride Vehicles and Mounts<br></li><li>Travel to other Islands and Planets<br></li><li>Raise Dragons<br></li><li>Capture Enemies<br></li><li>Level up your Skills<br></li><li>Go Fishing<br></li><li>Explore Secrets</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Who are We?</h2><br>We\u2019re Fancy Fish Games - a small indie team that has released 12 games, 5 commercially on Steam (including Aground), since 2012. We follow our passion, making games that catch our fancy - our games tend to be quirky, surprising or thought-provoking.",
